  m_Text: 'Facing forward, towards the direction of your table/set-up, press the
    A button on you RIGHT CONTROLLER to start.


    Use the LEFT and RIGHT JOYSTICKS,
    to change the height and lateral position of the grid(table) in front of you.


    NOTE:
    If you''re pointing at the UI while moving the joy sticks, the grid(table) will
    not move.


    When you''re ready, set the id, condition, mode and range as
    directed.


    Click the START BUTTON on your LEFT CONTROLLER to begin.'
